name unisc
category Package
revision 63178
shortdesc Unicode small caps with Lua/XeLaTeX
longdesc LaTeX produces small caps with \textsc{text} or {\scshape
longdesc text}. Neither of these commands produce small caps in Unicode.
longdesc If the output text is copied and pasted somewhere it shows the
longdesc same characters as used in the input. This package aims to
longdesc internally convert all the characters provided to the commands
longdesc mentioned above. It assumes that the file using this package is
longdesc compiled with Lua/XeLaTeX and a good Unicode font which has the
longdesc small caps characters, e.g., Charis SIL.
